  "intro": {
    "title": "Woher kommst du?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Kommen is regular in the present and irregular in the past (ist gekommen). It's the base of many verbs: ankommen, mitkommen, bekommen. And woher kommst du? is the first question you'll be asked."
    ]
  },
